! DnDWiki Core

The shared D&D format layer of the DnDWiki repo family:

* Type hubs (Person, Location, Organisation, Event, Item, Map, BattleMap, ...) with colours,
  view templates, macros, filters, styles and editor snippets (`$:/plugins/dndwiki-core/...`)
* Language packs: displayed texts come from `$:/dndwiki/language/<code>/...` and follow
  `$:/language`; en-GB and de-DE included, missing keys fall back to en-GB
* Calendar engine: dates are formatted and calculated from the calendar data tiddler named in
  `$:/config/dndwiki/calendar` (e.g. Harptos from `dndwiki-forgottenrealms`); without it
  dates are shown as entered
* Functions `dnd.visible` (player lock), `dnd.dead` (deceased/destroyed), `dnd.t`,
  `dnd.title`, `dnd.plural` in `$:/plugins/dndwiki-core/functions`
* tw5-graph schema (field edge types + graph templates) for the relation graphs
* Event timeline (widget `dnd-timeline`): the events of a tiddler or of the `Event` hub as an
  interactive vertical timeline in the calendar of the wiki, next to the event table

Consumed by the campaign wikis as a pinned plugin
(`git+https://github.com/WkoD/TiddlyDnD-Plugins.git#<version>`).

The format layer is edited only in the plugin repo.
